WEBVTT

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.390
Mr. Leon.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.930
Please...

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.230
Please save Angie.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.240
I will. That's my job.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.420
<b>Trapped in</b>

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.760
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:37.390
<b>Trapped in
a Dating Sim</b>

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:59.530
What I Can Do Now

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:57.130
Let's go, Luxion.

00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:59.800
Angelica is inside that ship.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.010
Princess Hertrude appears to be with her.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.770
In the game, the princess had a magic flute.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:09.010
We'll take the magic flute 
while we're rescuing Angie.

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:10.030
Let's force our way through.

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:11.520
Ready when you are.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:15.690
Take this!

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:23.330
See that? That's how strong you and I are!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.290
Look at how incredible we 
are when we work together!

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:29.300
Work together? I'm doing 
most of the work here.

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.290
It would be more accurate 
to say you're assisting me.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.790
Whatever! Let's go on to the next thing!

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.050
You really are trash, aren't you?

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.590
Yahoo!

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:44.550
Bartfort, will I ever be like you?

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:50.140
Boys, let's do whatever it 
takes to protect the ship!

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.560
Yeah!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:54.740
They're coming!

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:57.070
Calm down and take your positions.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:58.790
They're charging us!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.390
Mr. Chris!

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:03.650
We made a promise to Bartfort.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.450
We won't let this ship fall!

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:06.650
Barriers up!

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.000
Prepare to intercept.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.210
Scatter them!

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.840
Ship spotted at nine o'clock.

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.090
What is it?

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.090
It appears to be an air bike.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:21.330
Schwert...

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:26.920
Leon...

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:35.820
Bring me my magic flute again.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:36.360
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:39.320
<i>You fool. You're such a fool.</i>

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:43.820
<i>You would've been strong enough to flee.</i>

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:54.000
They're coming. Intercept them!

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:59.510
How foolish. Resisting will 
only make it more painful.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.270
Silence. The nobles of the kingdom 
are descended from adventurers.

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.740
They're far stronger than you think.

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.760
They don't give up easily, either.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:14.710
They're showing some backbone, 
just like you wanted.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:18.330
The one leading the charge is one of the 
kingdom's most distinguished knights,

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.280
Leon Fou Bartfort.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.680
Bartfort...

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.030
They certainly don't give up easily.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.170
But it all ends here.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:34.540
They'll be within range of our cannons soon.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:38.540
We'll send them all falling, 
including the monsters.

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:43.550
Gelatt, you're going to use the 
monsters I control as bait?

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:48.050
We can easily get our hands on 
as many monsters as we need.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:51.050
<i>Leon... Livia...</i>

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:53.770
I'm surprised.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.810
About what?

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:58.550
The academy's students, 
especially the male students.

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:01.640
They're putting up a good 
fight against the monsters.

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:04.320
I expected them to struggle more.

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:07.440
The kingdom's nobles are strong 
to begin with because they're

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.070
descended from adventurers.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:13.330
They train all the time 
so girls will marry them.

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:15.460
If they're serious about finding wives,

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:19.350
they become stalwart warriors 
by the time they graduate.

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.960
The results are touching.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.310
Take this!

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:26.090
We'll handle this. We'll do whatever 
it takes to protect the girls!

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:28.340
Another wave is coming!

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.470
Make the barrier thicker!

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.970
Out of the way.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.810
Ms. Deirdre!

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:37.020
Rose Hurricane!

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:43.250
I shall blow away these foul monsters.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.700
Something smells nice.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.490
Do I smell roses?

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.490
Ignore the small ones.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:55.910
Let the guys on the ship handle 
the rest while we do our job.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.170
Right!

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:01.530
Are you all right?

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:06.030
Y-Yeah. I've never seen healing magic before.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.930
And you nobles don't disappoint.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.170
You're all so courageous.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.310
They're firing on us!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.320
They're pointing their cannons at us.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:27.190
Are they going to blast their monsters, too?

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.370
No!

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:29.310
What should we do?

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:31.250
We can't block that!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.060
N-No!

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.410
Damn it.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.550
They're coming!

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:40.920
<i>No.</i>

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.200
Damn!

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.920
<i>No!</i>

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:48.450
<i>No!</i>

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:54.930
No!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:08.070
<i>I need to do what I can do now!</i>

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.950
Th-The monsters...

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:17.160
Amazing.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.700
Has she always been a student?

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.320
No wonder you got a scholarship.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:23.960
Your magical talent is on another level.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:31.970
<i>Go, Mr. Leon. I'll protect the ship.</i>

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:36.470
So that's the Saint. How marvelous.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.740
I'm surprised, too.

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:42.240
She lacks the Saint's key items, 
but she's still so powerful.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:44.230
It's the product of her studying.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:47.730
She put honest effort into 
studying while at the academy.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.770
It's what she gained from meeting you.

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:55.990
She had time to study 
because you protected her.

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.870
As long as it wasn't for nothing.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.700
This is a good opportunity for us.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.870
We can charge in without 
worrying about our rear.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:08.090
Yeah. Ms. Olivia created 
this precious window for us.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.630
I won't waste it.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:14.380
Selecting the shortest route. 
Try not to fall off.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:18.390
Th-The shortest route?

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.390
You mean we're going inside its mouth?!

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:33.160
What an uncomfortable ride this ship is.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:36.030
As if riding a monster 
wasn't tasteless enough.

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:38.530
How could you say that? It's so cute.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:41.290
Cute <i>how</i>?! Are you blind?!

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:44.490
Your allegedly distinguished 
knight leading the charge

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:47.420
seems to have been eaten by this ship.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:53.230
We shall record his name in the 
history books of the principality.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:58.930
He'll be remembered as the total idiot who 
died pointlessly defying the principality alone.

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:05.060
Leon!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:05.940
Get down!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.350
Take this, dumbstache!

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:21.080
You're coming with me. 
This time you'll be our hostage.

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:24.780
I underestimated you, knight of the kingdom.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:27.590
Will you tell me your name?

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.640
Don't try to buy time. 
I'm taking your magic flute, too.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:36.470
You'd better do as I say, or else.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:44.470
Master, that's a replica. 
The maid has the real one.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:48.070
Permanent hair removal mode on.

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:54.140
Too bad, princess.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:57.990
<i>A rubber bullet?</i>

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:00.650
<i>So he just knocked her unconscious.</i>

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:08.360
All right. Princess, you'll 
be coming onto our ship.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:09.810
Have it your way.

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:12.900
Leon, what's happening?

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:15.500
It's because we took out the 
monster beneath the ship.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:16.880
We need to hurry.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:18.370
The mother ship!

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:19.890
Where is the princess?

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:30.150
Hey! Your precious princess is right here!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:34.150
Get out of the way! You'd better 
move your asses now, or else!

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:34.990
That's playing dirty!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:35.980
Coward!

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:37.150
And you call yourself a knight?!

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.780
Idiots! Take a look in the mirror!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:52.200
You're unbelievable.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:01.070
<i>Thank you, Leon.</i>

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:08.950
Mr. Gelatt, you're all right!

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.270
What is it?

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:13.400
What happened to your mustache?

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:16.270
Shut up! Prepare for battle!

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:16.810
Yes, sir!

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:19.070
Damn him.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.930
<i>Ms. Olivia seems pretty wiped out.</i>

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:34.420
Bartfort!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:37.670
The enemy has stopped 
attacking. What should we do?

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:42.180
All that's left to do is flee back 
home with the princess as our hosta—

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:47.700
All ships, the princess has 
sacrificed herself for the principality.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.980
Launch an all-out attack!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:50.680
Wha—

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:53.310
They're telling their own princess to die?

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:56.780
This won't be enough to stop the principality.

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:58.940
I can be replaced.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.200
What did you do?!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:10.700
I released the monsters from my control.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:15.370
They'll attack the one 
who was controlling them.

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:18.020
Before long, they'll gather around this ship.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:25.310
<i>If the battle continues, Ms. Olivia 
will attempt to use that spell again.</i>

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:27.470
Damn it.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.230
Luxion, we need to buy time.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:33.730
I'm fine with that. I'd follow 
you to the ends of the earth.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:35.690
Leon!

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:38.190
Bartfort!

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:39.670
Leon...

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:41.020
Positions, everyone!

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:42.190
Yeah!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.020
Damn!

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:44.370
I can't keep going.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:48.200
Quit complaining! Get the injured inside!

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:48.200
We can't let it end like this!

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:51.550
<i>What can I do?</i>

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:55.380
Master, isn't this a few too 
many enemies for you to handle?

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:56.470
Shut up!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.020
<i>For the kingdom.</i>

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.740
Piece of shit!

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:03.420
<i>For Leon.</i>

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.850
Are these Fire Lances?

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:20.000
But I've never been able 
to cast this spell before.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:28.490
Incinerate my—no, Leon's enemies!

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:32.120
<i>Angie...</i>

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:33.370
<i>Leon!</i>

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:36.620
Livia!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:37.850
You fiend!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:42.290
Livia, what are you doing? Get out of here!

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:44.880
A-Angie...

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:49.660
Did you expend too much magic power?

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:53.580
I wanted to be useful.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:59.150
All I've ever done is hold 
you and Mr. Leon back.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.370
I wanted you two to acknowledge me.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.870
I wanted us to become real friends.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.660
So I tried my best.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:14.240
Idiot! You did plenty!

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.910
You've never held us back.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:19.920
Angie...

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:27.920
You fool. I'll give you all 
the acknowledgment you want.

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:36.530
You're my dear friend, Livia.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.940
Angie...

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:48.950
<i>You fool, Livia...</i>

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:10.710
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:16.390
<i>If I'd known this would happen, 
I would've told them how I felt sooner.</i>

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:18.850
<i>Livia...</i>

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:20.200
<i>Father...</i>

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.270
<i>Brother...</i>

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:22.650
<i>Your Highness...</i>

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:30.200
<i>I see... I...</i>

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:36.210
Be a good friend to Livia, Leon.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:44.370
Livia...

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.630
You fool! It's too dangerous! Run!

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.280
No!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.630
Don't do this! That's enough!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:53.640
No! You...

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:56.390
You're important to me, too, Angie!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:59.890
Y-You fool! You'll fall, too!

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:05.100
But... But you said we were friends.

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:09.020
You're important to me, too!

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.280
You fool. That's a terrible reason.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:16.410
I don't care if it makes me a fool.

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:19.530
As long as we can be friends.

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:22.790
As long as we can be together.

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:25.270
Livia...

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:34.680
Livia!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:38.680
Livia!

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:42.930
Livia!

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:53.190
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:58.700
<i>I knew Mr. Leon would come save me.</i>

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:05.050
<i>Shit. She looks so damn relieved.</i>

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:07.210
Luxion, handle the piloting.

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:11.250
I'll match her relative speed. Hold on tight.

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.060
Now's the time to be overprotective.

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:15.220
Oh, shut up.

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:30.110
You're all right now. I'll get you to 
the ship, so don't worry, Ms. Olivia.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:32.360
It's Livia.

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:34.510
L-Listen...

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:38.010
It's Livia! Why won't you call me "Livia"?

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:40.370
Do you hate me now?

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:43.620
Please don't call me "Ms. Olivia"!

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:47.010
You can't be with me.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:50.250
You should find a better man to be with.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:53.520
Why are you talking about other men?

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:55.100
We just can't, Ms. Olivia.

00:17:55.100 --> 00:18:00.390
There are guys who would be a better match 
for you, like handsome or wealthy men.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.490
You're calling me Ms. Olivia again.

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:04.610
I don't care about that!

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:06.020
I'm telling you...

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.520
There's...

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.700
There's Prince Julius!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:15.300
I hate him. He made Angie cry.

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.540
Then how about Jilk?

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.280
He's rotten on the inside.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:18.990
Brad!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:19.910
A narcissist!

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:20.620
Greg!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:21.280
A meathead!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:21.770
Chris!

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:22.910
Needy!

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:25.130
I don't want anyone else.

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:27.810
I want to be with you, Mr. Leon.

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:31.420
I want to have fun with you and 
Angie again, like we used to.

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:35.170
But that's not good for you.

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:37.420
I want to be with you!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:40.430
What's so great about me? I'm just a mo—

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.180
I, Livia, am in love with you, Mr. Leon.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.010
That's all there is to it.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:51.190
I love you!

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.950
Going up, Master.

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:04.450
Uh, sure.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.500
<i>I don't know what the right answer is.</i>

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:14.210
<i>As far as this world is concerned, 
it might be wrong, but...</i>

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:19.970
Hold on tight, L-Livia.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:25.190
Okay.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:34.730
My clothes are so thick, 
I can't feel anything!

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:39.740
I custom-made your suit so it'd be 
highly resistant to external pressure.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:42.670
I should've expected that from you!

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:48.490
Leon! Livia!

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:49.990
Angie!

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:53.500
You fool! I was so worried about you!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.680
I'm sorry.

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:57.190
I'm glad you're all right.

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:01.290
Luxion.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:04.510
Sorry it took so long. It's finally arrived.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.360
What's that ship?

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:14.520
Is it an enemy ship?

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:17.520
That's the <i>Partner</i>.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:20.900
New ship spotted. 700-meter class.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:23.660
Forward cannons taking aim at two warships.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.410
Fire away.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.770
Wh-What just happened?

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:34.830
Enemy cannon fire. They've 
destroyed our protective barrier.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:35.920
Wha—

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:40.920
First he took my mustache, 
now he's taking my fleet?

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:44.430
All right. We'll rescue everyone 
while acting as a shield

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:46.980
between the passenger ship and the fleet.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:48.810
Roger that.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:54.310
Bartfort, can you fight?

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:57.310
I'll show them who they 
tried to pick a fight with.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:02.130
I'll teach the dumbasses of the principality 
just how terrifying I can be.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:04.200
Your personality is totally twisted.

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:06.980
Leon, the rest is up to you.

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:09.450
Promise you'll come back.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:12.380
Luxion, get me my large rifle and blade.

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:14.460
Opening container one.

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:21.650
Now, let's go shatter their will to fight.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:24.340
You truly are a villain, Master.

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:27.490
Another Armor!

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:30.260
S-Sir, we must retreat.

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:33.530
Don't be stupid! They've taken 
the princess and the magic flute.

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:35.300
To top it all off, we lost to a child.

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:38.060
You think we can just leave now?

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:39.360
B-But...

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:45.740
A-Ah, right. We still have you.

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:50.650
The principality's most powerful hero, 
Sir Vandel the Black Knight.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.750
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim</b>

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:28.260
The Black Knight is a cool nickname.

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:30.440
Shall we come up with a 
nickname for you, Mr. Leon?

00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:32.770
At the rate you're going, it should 
be the "Black-Hearted Knight."

00:23:32.770 --> 00:23:33.510
That's so mean.

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:37.770
Next time, "No Matter How Tough 
the World of Otome Games Is."

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:39.270
You're breaking my heart here.
